{\rtf\ansi \deff0{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue128;}{\fonttbl{\f0
\fcharset0\fnil Arial;}}\plain\cf1\fs20 \pard by\par \par Vinh Bui, 
Anuj Mehta, Vincent Park, Jim Roberts, Satish Yelamanchi\par }
.TXT 10 3 16684 0 0
Cg a86.250000,86.250000,581
{\rtf\ansi \deff0{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue128;}{\fonttbl{\f0
\fcharset0\fnil Arial;}}\plain\cf1\fs20 \pard Most of the definitions 
and equations remain the same in this document. To illustrate \par the 
effects of using a hard limiter and filter, many of the frequencies 
have been modified. \par The idea was to ensure (1) that the plot of 
the FM waveform illustrated its consistent \par amplitude prior to the 
addition of noise, (2) that the plot of the FM waveform with noise 
\par illustrated the variations in amplitude, and (3) illustrate how 
the limiter/filter helps correct \par the problem.  Obviously, the 
selected frequencies are not optimum for other aspects, such \par as 
viewing the message spectrum. }
.TXT 18 -3 16673 0 0
